<title>UK: Persimmon profits rise after Ideal buy.</title>
<headline>Persimmon profits rise after Ideal buy.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		5.2		    vs 5.3</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 3.0		    vs 3.0</p>
<p> Pretax before charges  14.2		   vs 9.73</p>
<p> Pretax after charges   11.10		  vs 9.73</p>
<p> Turnover		   202.35		 vs 115.10</p>
<p>NOTE - Housebuilder Persimmon Plc said the results include four months of trading from Ideal Homes which it acquired in February.  </p>
<p> Operating result	 16.83		  vs 13.18</p>
<p> Exceptional charge     3.10		   vs nil</p>
<p> Interest charge	  5.73		   vs 3.41</p>
<p> Tax			  2.98		   vs 3.36</p>
<p> Net taxed		  8.11		   vs 6.37</p>
<p> Attributable	     2.85		   vs 2.86</p>
<p> Pay date		   Oct 21</p>
<p>Div registration date  Sept 17  Ex-div date		Sept 9</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
